ttp://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"REL\"><mo>:=</mo></mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>x</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>.</li>\n</ol>\n</div>","file":"ch2/commutative-rings.html"}